            "text": "<p>In addition to breast pumps, TRICARE may cover certain replacement supplies for up to three years after the birth event. Ameda also offers accessories designed to support comfortable, convenient pumping, including:</p><ul><li>Breast milk storage bags</li><li>Replacement bottles, caps and locking rings</li><li>Replacement valves, membranes and tubing</li><li>Silicone flange inserts for a more personalized fit</li><li>Cleaning products to help maintain pump hygiene</li><li>Breast pump kits and other replacement components</li></ul><p>Coverage and replacement limits vary by item. An Ameda representative can help you understand your benefits and identify the supplies and accessories that best fit your needs.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_RdwcmT": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Explore Breastfeeding Accessories",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/accessories",
